<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'About' }) %>

<div class="hero" style="padding-top:20px;">
  <img class="logo-big" src="/img/logo.svg" alt="Long Challenge" />
  <h1>The <span>long game</span> of getting things done.</h1>
  <p>
    Long Challenge is a bounty board for real work: anyone can post a challenge \u2014 "make a video
    about X", "write launch content for Y", "design a Z" \u2014 back it with a reward, and let the
    community compete to deliver it. Every challenge and every submitted entry is reviewed by hand
    before it goes live or gets paid, so rewards only ever go to real, approved work.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="stat-grid">
  <div class="card stat"><div class="num"><%= stats.challenges %></div><div class="lbl">Challenges posted</div></div>
  <div class="card stat"><div class="num"><%= stats.published %></div><div class="lbl">Published</div></div>
  <div class="card stat"><div class="num"><%= stats.completed %></div><div class="lbl">Completed &amp; paid out</div></div>
  <div class="card stat"><div class="num"><%= stats.users %></div><div class="lbl">Members</div></div>
</div>

<div class="section-title"><h2>How it works</h2></div>
<div class="grid">
  <div class="card">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0;">1. Post a challenge</h3>
    <p class="muted">Pick a category (video, content, design, writing, or anything else), write clear
      instructions for what a winner needs to do, set a reward in <%= CURRENCY.symbol %>, and an
      optional deadline.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0;">2. We review it</h3>
    <p class="muted">Your reward plus a 10% platform fee is escrowed immediately. Every new challenge
      is checked before it's published \u2014 approved challenges go live on the board; rejected ones
      are fully refunded, with a reason.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0;">3. The community submits</h3>
    <p class="muted">Anyone can submit an entry \u2014 a link to their work plus a short note \u2014 to any
      published challenge.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0;">4. We pick the winner</h3>
    <p class="muted">Submissions are reviewed the same way. The approved winning entry is paid the full
      reward instantly; other entries are marked not selected and can try again on future challenges.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section-title"><h2>Currency &amp; roadmap</h2></div>
<div class="card">
  <p><strong><%= CURRENCY.symbol %></strong> is what challenges are funded and paid out in today.</p>
  <p class="muted"><%= CURRENCY.disclaimer %></p>
  <hr class="sep" />
  <p><strong>What's next:</strong> Long Challenge is moving to its own token, <strong>$<%= CURRENCY.futureSymbol %></strong>,
    launching on <a href="https://long.xyz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">long.xyz</a>. Once it launches,
    challenge rewards will be paid out in $<%= CURRENCY.futureSymbol %> directly to winners' own wallets \u2014
    Long Challenge never holds or has access to your private keys.</p>
</div>

<div class="section-title"><h2>Trust &amp; safety</h2></div>
<div class="card">
  <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--text-muted);">
    <li>Sign in with your X account \u2014 we only read your username and avatar to identify you. No posting, no DMs, no wallet access, ever.</li>
    <li>Every challenge and submission is manually reviewed before it's published or paid.</li>
    <li>Rejected challenges are always fully refunded.</li>
    <li>We do not generate or custody wallets for users. Any future on-chain payouts go directly to a wallet address you control.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
